    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686510/extras/5110b0d238b9034dd8b4113b28498461.avif?t=1754878012\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitsune vs. Tanuki! A fast, fun, and chaotic bullet hell showdown begins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fox Flare Night, you play as Mio, a modern-day Kitsune (fox spirit) who faces off against a mischievous army of Tanuki\u2014shape-shifting raccoon dogs from Japanese folklore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-scrolling shooter that mixes high-speed action, over-the-top bullet dodging, and a lighthearted, comedic vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful y\u014djutsu (fox magic) and transformation skills to break through wild barrages of enemy fire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, get stronger, and outwit the unpredictable Tanuki bosses waiting at every turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686510/extras/26fa47360809df1d54d01f21549a6d6c.avif?t=1754878012\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive Action with a Foxy Twist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbControl Mio the Kitsune, using magical attacks and transformation abilities to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbBuilt-in auto-shield mechanics help newcomers survive even the wildest bullet storms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Stronger, Fight Smarter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbUpgrade your character and learn new magical abilities to take on tougher stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbDevelop your own strategies and playstyle to master every challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wacky Battles with the Tanuki Army</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbThese tricky Tanuki can transform into anything\u2014from furniture to mechas\u2014and attack in hilarious ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbFace off against a variety of unique Tanuki bosses, each with their own bizarre attacks and transformations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun for Everyone\u2014Casual or Hardcore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbEnjoy easy-to-pick-up gameplay for casual fun, or test your skills with arcade-style high-difficulty modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbPerfect for both short sessions and deep, long-term mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Game in Training Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbPractice freely with a fully customizable training mode\u2014tweak enemy patterns, speed, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbIdeal for perfecting your dodges, planning routes, or chasing high scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extras Galore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbUnlock an in-game illustration gallery, complete achievements, and explore plenty of bonus content!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686510/extras/5110b0d238b9034dd8b4113b28498461.avif?t=1754878012\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitsune vs. Tanuki! A fast, fun, and chaotic bullet hell showdown begins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fox Flare Night, you play as Mio, a modern-day Kitsune (fox spirit) who faces off against a mischievous army of Tanuki\u2014shape-shifting raccoon dogs from Japanese folklore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-scrolling shooter that mixes high-speed action, over-the-top bullet dodging, and a lighthearted, comedic vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful y\u014djutsu (fox magic) and transformation skills to break through wild barrages of enemy fire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, get stronger, and outwit the unpredictable Tanuki bosses waiting at every turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686510/extras/26fa47360809df1d54d01f21549a6d6c.avif?t=1754878012\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive Action with a Foxy Twist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbControl Mio the Kitsune, using magical attacks and transformation abilities to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbBuilt-in auto-shield mechanics help newcomers survive even the wildest bullet storms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Stronger, Fight Smarter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbUpgrade your character and learn new magical abilities to take on tougher stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbDevelop your own strategies and playstyle to master every challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wacky Battles with the Tanuki Army</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbThese tricky Tanuki can transform into anything\u2014from furniture to mechas\u2014and attack in hilarious ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbFace off against a variety of unique Tanuki bosses, each with their own bizarre attacks and transformations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun for Everyone\u2014Casual or Hardcore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbEnjoy easy-to-pick-up gameplay for casual fun, or test your skills with arcade-style high-difficulty modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbPerfect for both short sessions and deep, long-term mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Game in Training Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbPractice freely with a fully customizable training mode\u2014tweak enemy patterns, speed, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbIdeal for perfecting your dodges, planning routes, or chasing high scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extras Galore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u30fbUnlock an in-game illustration gallery, complete achievements, and explore plenty of bonus content!</p>",
    "short_description": "Shape-shifting Kitsune Mio battles the mischievous Tanuki army in this fast-paced, comedic side-scrolling shooter! Unleash powerful y\u014djutsu and transformations to dodge bullet barrages. Packed with modes for both casual and hardcore players, offering plenty of content to master!",
